<mw12F schema="1" type="state" name="First Squelch" author="mwAudio" tags="Seq,Showcase,Saw,Medium,Squelchy,Rubbery" description="The first-load scene in A, written for about 125 BPM. Bank A: A1 main line, A2 the line moved along the grid, A3 the accents moved one note later, A4 a breakdown on the beats, A5 a two-bar call and answer, A6 a fill in the last beat, A7 a cluster of slides, A8 the Anthem line Bright Signal, A9 the Chicago line Jack Street, A10 the Hard line Triplet Furnace, A11 the Polymeter line Thirteen Doors, A12 the Melodic line Glass River.">
